  "id": "marginalization",
  "term": "marginalization",
  "definition": "Marginalization is the sense of being outside the social mainstream and feeling unseen, unrecognized, or unimportant. In this context, it is shaped by social factors such as gender, race, disability, age, and physical appearance and reflects perceived structural barriers across a person’s life.",
